QuestGuidance.Register("en",245,{
[7809]="70062F20\n1\tSpeak with the Krahjarn emissary\tYou may seek the blessing of the Krahjarn clan. All you need do is renounce all other clans.\n",
[7810]="7004A9DA\n1\tDefeat Dulgan\tDefeat Dulgan.\n2\tTalk to Candúr\tYou should return to Candúr and apprise him of your efforts.\n",
[7811]="7004A9E5\n1\tDefeat spiders\tDefeat spiders.\n2\tDefeat spiders (total: 15)\tDefeat spiders.\n3\tTalk to Candúr\tTalk to Candúr.\n",
[7812]="7004A9E3\n1\tGather silk\tGather silk.\n2\tGather silk (total: 8)\tGather silk.\n3\tBring the silk to Candúr\tBring the silk to Candúr.\n",
[7813]="70050A0B\n1\tDefeat Káldbak, Scourge of the Withered Heath\tKáldbak poses a great threat to all that enter the Withered Heath.\n2\tDefeat Káldbak, Scourge of the Withered Heath\tKáldbak poses a great threat to all that enter the Withered Heath.\n3\tCompleted\tKáldbak poses a great threat to all that enter the Withered Heath.\n",
[7814]="7003FE0F\n1\tPlant banners at Kêr Bras (total: 6)\tKêr Bras is within the Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth. Avordur asked you to venture to Kêr Bras within the Paths of the Dead and plant several banners of Gondor to show you do not fear the Ruthless Dead.\n2\tTalk to Avordur\tAvordur is in Dol Amroth, far to the south of the Paths of the Dead. Avordur will be pleased to hear you planted the banners within Kêr Bras.\n",
[7815]="7003FE12\n1\tGather Blooms of Decay from Kêr Bras (total: 6)\tBlooms of Decay can be found at Kêr Bras, inside the Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth. Avordur asked you to gather several Blooms of Decay from Kêr Bras.\n2\tTalk to Avordur\tAvordur is in Dol Amroth, far to the south of the Paths of the Dead. Avordur will be pleased to begin working on the Blooms of Decay you recovered.\n",
[7816]="7003FE11\n1\tLacquer the ground beneath quieted Ruthless Oathbreakers at Kêr Bras (total: 6)\tKêr Bras is within the Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth. Avordur asked you to apply a lacquer to the ground beneath any Ruthless Dead you quiet. This should prevent any taint.\n2\tTalk to Avordur\tAvordur is in Dol Amroth, far to the south of the Paths of the Dead. Avordur will be interested to hear if the lacquer worked.\n",
[7817]="7003FE10\n1\tQuiet Ruthless Dead at Kêr Bras (total: 10)\tRuthless Dead are at Kêr Bras, within the Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth. Avordur asked you to quiet as many Ruthless Dead within Kêr Bras as you can manage.\n2\tTalk to Avordur\tAvordur is in Dol Amroth, far to the south of the Paths of the Dead. Avordur will be pleased you quieted many Ruthless Dead within Kêr Bras.\n",
[7818]="7003FE0D\n1\tRecover remains from Kêr Izel (total: 8)\tFallen adventurers can be found at Kêr Izel, within Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth. Golusel asked you to return any remains of those you found within the Paths of the Dead.\n2\tTalk to Golusel\tGolusel is in Dol Amroth. Golusel will be eager to properly bury the remains you have recovered.\n",
[7819]="7003FE0A\n1\tRemove ruthless rune-stones from Lenn Dûskud (total: 8)\tLenn Dûskud, a small pond, is at Kêr Izel, within the Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth. Golusel asked you to venture to a pond within the Paths of the Dead and clear it of any foul objects.\n2\tTalk to Golusel\tGolusel is in Dol Amroth. Golusel will be pleased to hear the waters have been cleansed.\n",
[7820]="7003FE0E\n1\tDefeat Ruthless Dead in Kêr Izel (total: 10)\tRuthless Dead can be found within Kêr Izel, in the Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth. Golusel asked you to quiet the Ruthless Dead within the lower city of the Paths of the Dead.\n2\tTalk to Golusel\tGolusel is in Dol Amroth. Golusel will be pleased to hear many Ruthless Dead have been quieted.\n",
[7821]="7003FE0C\n1\tDefeat Ruthless Banner-bearers at the Shadow-watch (total: 3)\tThe Shadow-watch is within Kêr Izel, in the Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth. Golusel asked you to venture to the Paths of the Dead and disperse some Ruthless Dead who are preying on travellers from an overlook.\n2\tTalk to Golusel\tGolusel is in Dol Amroth. Golusel will be pleased to hear the Paths of the Dead should be safer for a period of time.\n",
[7822]="70072C05\n1\tDefeat Rátinur and Gáthtrag Gloomhammer\tKôth Rau is a bastion for those who wish to subjugate the populace in An Shêru. Seek out and defeat the leaders within.\n2\tDefeat Sorceress Ombátha\tAs you further explore Kôth Rau, seek out Sorceress Ombátha and defeat her.\n3\tDefeat Râkdakul\tAs you further explore Kôth Rau, seek out Râkdakul and defeat the foul creature.\n",
[7823]="70072C02\n1\tDefeat Rátinur and Gáthtrag Gloomhammer\tKôth Rau is a bastion for those who wish to subjugate the populace in An Shêru. Seek out and defeat the leaders within.\n2\tDefeat Sorceress Ombátha\tAs you further explore Kôth Rau, seek out Sorceress Ombátha and defeat her.\n3\tDefeat Râkdakul\tAs you further explore Kôth Rau, seek out Râkdakul and defeat the foul creature.\n",
[7824]="70072C04\n1\tDefeat Rátinur and Gáthtrag Gloomhammer\tKôth Rau is a bastion for those who wish to subjugate the populace in An Shêru. Seek out and defeat the leaders within.\n2\tDefeat Sorceress Ombátha\tAs you further explore Kôth Rau, seek out Sorceress Ombátha and defeat her.\n3\tDefeat Râkdakul\tAs you further explore Kôth Rau, seek out Râkdakul and defeat the foul creature.\n",
[7825]="70072C03\n1\tDefeat Rátinur and Gáthtrag Gloomhammer\tKôth Rau is a bastion for those who wish to subjugate the populace in An Shêru. Seek out and defeat the leaders within.\n2\tDefeat Sorceress Ombátha\tAs you further explore Kôth Rau, seek out Sorceress Ombátha and defeat her.\n3\tDefeat Râkdakul\tAs you further explore Kôth Rau, seek out Râkdakul and defeat the foul creature.\n",
[7826]="70019606\n1\tShow the marsh-fly queen to someone at the Hunter's Lodge\tThe Hunter's Lodge is to the east of Archet. You should take the carcass of the marsh-fly queen to the Hunter's Lodge to see if anyone has more information for you.\n",
[7827]="7005AAA7\n1\tFind Molkha\tMolkha has been sent to find the frost-drakes inside the Pit of Stonejaws. You should find Molkha somewhere in the tunnels east of Bárgstad.\n2\tComplete 'Quelling the Horde'\030Complete 'If You Want to Make a Hearty Egg Breakfast...'\030Complete 'Food for Their Young'\030Complete 'Frost-bound Nest-tenders'\030Find information about Loknashra\tMolkha needs your help.\n3\tTalk to Molkha\tYou should return to Molkha.\n",
[7828]="70000176\n1\tEscort Lalia to safety\tYou must take Lalia to the North-gate of the Barrow-downs. Lalia has asked you to help her get back to Bree safely. In addition, she has asked for your help finding the cloak she dropped somewhere in the Barrow-downs. You should protect her as she searches for her cloak, then leaves the Barrow-downs.\n2\tBring Lalia's cloak to Bob\tBob can be found along the Old Forest Road, between the Barrow-downs and the Old Forest. You have helped Lalia make her way home. As thanks, she has given you her cloak. She has asked you to bring it to her father, Bob, Barliman Butterbur's assistant, as proof that she is safe. You did not have the heart to tell her that Bob was looking for her within the Barrow-downs himself.\n",
[7829]="7006E4C6\n1\tApproach Lalia\tLalia was expected to be between the Northern Barrow and the Dead Spire where \"The Last Prince\" was said to be entombed, and that is exactly where you found her. You should approach the crying child.\n2\tTalk to Lalia\tYou found Lalia between the Northern Barrow and the Dead Spire as expected. You should talk to the crying child.\n3\tEscort Lalia to safety\tLalia has asked you to help her get back to Bree safely. In addition, she has asked for your help finding the cloak she dropped somewhere on the Barrow-downs. You must protect her as she searches for her cloak, then leaves the Barrow-downs.\n",
[7830]="7002658D\n1\tHonour the fallen Rangers (total: 5)\tMany Rangers have fallen while defending the city from Angmar. They should be honoured.\n2\tTalk to Orchalwë\tOrchalwë will be pleased to hear that you honoured the fallen Rangers.\n",
[7831]="70047BC5\n1\tCarefully collect a sample of Trollstrife\tTrollstrife can be found on the sides of trees in the Noman-lands. Mílgamel has asked you to gather Trollstrife and then meet her at Haerondir in the Noman-lands.\n2\tDeliver the Trollstrife to Mílgamel at Haerondir\tMílgamel can be found at Haerondir in the eastern reaches of the Noman-lands. You have carefully gathered the Trollstrife and should now deliver it to Mílgamel at Haerondir.\n",
[7832]="70040E07\n1\tDestroy rowing boats\tRowing boats can be found on the shore at Hashadîr, south of Dol Amroth. You should compromise the rowing boats' ability to float.\n2\tDestroy the bottoms of rowing boats (total: 6)\tRowing boats can be found on the shore at Hashadîr, south of Dol Amroth. You should compromise the rowing boats' ability to float.\n3\tFind the last rowing boat, and use it to get to the tall ships\tThe last rowing boat can be found on the shore at Hashadîr, south of Dol Amroth. You should find the last rowing boat, and take it to the tall ships anchored offshore.\n4\tCompleted\tThe last rowing boat can be found on the shore at Hashadîr, south of Dol Amroth. You should take the last rowing boat to the tall ships anchored offshore.\n",
[7833]="700698B9\n1\tSpeak to Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth.\n",
[7834]="7002F174\n1\tTalk to Egg\tBy completing this quest, you will receive a set of Landscape Gear.\n",
[7835]="70047B43\n1\tDefeat foes in Lang Rhuven (total: 20)\tMany foes can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad. You should defeat the enemies in Lang Rhuven.\n2\tReturn to Candúr\tYou should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.\n",
[7836]="70047B42\n1\tDefeat cat-masters (total: 6)\030Defeat battle-cats (total: 12)\tCat-masters and battle-cats can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad. You should defeat cat-masters and battle-cats found in Lang Rhuven.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many cat-masters and battle-cats in Lang Rhuven.\n",
[7837]="70047B47\n1\tDestroy groups of tents in Lang Rhuven (total: 15)\030Destroy banners in Lang Rhuven (total: 15)\tEasterling tents and banners can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad. You should destroy tents and banners found in Lang Rhuven.\n2\tReturn to Candúr\tYou should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.\n",
[7838]="70047B3F\n1\tDefeat Uruk emissaries (total: 8)\030Defeat the Black Númenórean ambassador (quantity: see journal)\tUruk emissaries and the Black Númenórean ambassador can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad. You should defeat Uruk emissaries and the Black Númenórean ambassador found in Lang Rhuven.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated the Uruk emissaries and the Black Númenórean ambassador.\n",
[7839]="70047B45\n1\tFind the horses\tHorses can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad. You should free the horses in Lang Rhuven.\n2\tFree the horses in Lang Rhuven\tHorses can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad. You should free the horses in Lang Rhuven.\n3\tFree the horses in Lang Rhuven\tFreed the horses in Lang Rhuven.\n4\tReturn to Candúr\tYou should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.\n",
[7840]="70047B44\n1\tDefeat Khundolar tower-guards (total: 15)\tTower-guards can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad. You should defeat tower-guards found in Lang Rhuven.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many Khundolar tower-guards at Lang Rhuven.\n",
})
